<title>GREECE: Bomb destroys car in Athens, no injuries.</title>
<headline>Bomb destroys car in Athens, no injuries.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>A powerful bomb explosion wrecked a car belonging to a Greek NATO officer in central Athens on Thursday but no one was hurt, police said.</p>
<p>They said there were no immediate claims of responsibility for the attack, which shook the residential Kypseli district.</p>
<p>Leftist urban guerrillas operating in Athens have previously bombed cars belonging to diplomats and senior Greek officials.</p>
